hop_replan/task.md","text":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","time":{"start":1781562448057,"end":1781562448069}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d77d430774ad7c0016a307c50159c8191bc28ac28ddc6c368"}},"id":"prt_ecd6598b5001xrU5naSZ20ChJF","sessionID":"ses_1329a7efaffeLXGczGIqKMZ4Uq","messageID":"msg_ecd658a5f001oPKVpo1MLXO5Rh"}}
